<p>You now have a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27%</acronym> chance to Fold Fate, Gravity, or Warp into your Weapon Folding damage.</p><p></p><p>Fold Fate: Deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">16, 35, 49, 61, 71</acronym> temporal damage to enemies in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym>  Affected targets may lose 30% physical and temporal resistance for 2 turns.</p><p>Fold Warp: Deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">8.10, 17, 24, 30, 36</acronym> physical and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">8.10, 17, 24, 30, 36</acronym> temporal damage to enemies in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym>  Affected targets may be stunned, blinded, confused, or pinned for 2 turns.</p><p>Fold Gravity: Deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">16, 35, 49, 61, 71</acronym> physical damage to enemies in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym>  Affected targets will be slowed (30%) for 2 turns.</p><p></p><p>Each Fold has an eight turn cooldown.  If an effect would be triggered while on cooldown it will reduce the cooldown of the other two Folds by one turn.</p>